# prime-claw tier-1 Prime Agent selection.
#
# Copy to .env (gitignored). The only supported candidate path is a verified
# source checkout of https://github.com/SailorJoe6/prime-agent.git at annotated
# tag cwd-fix-v0.9.8-r1, built by the disposable Docker source builder.
# See docs/prime-agent-installation.md for mandatory identity checks. The
# existing tier-1 fixture does not yet enforce these fork identity checks;
# verify them independently before selecting any source candidate.
#
# Select exactly one supported candidate source: PRIME_AGENT_SOURCE. Leave
# PRIME_AGENT_PINNED empty; it is only for legacy fixture tests.
# Supported source checkout (read-only input; requires Docker):
#   PRIME_AGENT_SOURCE=/absolute/path/to/verified/prime-agent
#
# PRIME_AGENT_PINNED is retained temporarily for legacy fixture coverage only.
# Do not set it for a candidate: the current vendor installer selects a
# Rust/native artifact that cannot load Prime Claw's TypeScript plugin.
#
# Format: plain KEY=value lines, no inline comments. An empty value counts as
# unset. TIER1_ENV_FILE may select another env file for tests.

PRIME_AGENT_PINNED=
PRIME_AGENT_SOURCE=
